      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This has become an issue that effects you even if you are not in an instance, as vrchat doesn't even load in. I for one cannot factory reset my oculus to test if that is a possible solution, but it should not have to be a solution. When I first got my quest vrchat ran just fine, but then graphical \"improvements\" greatly hindered my ability to join worlds, as I could look at a direction and my headset would lag massively. However, now I simply cannot use vrchat, which is disappointing to say the least",
