  "details": "reproduction steps: Be on quest 2, join any populated public instance with zero avatar hiding safety settings on, and crash after 10 minutes.\n\nthis is really bad, please roll back your latest update (update 1296 as of this post being made) to un softban the majority of the entire quest userbase from this nonsense\n\n(this is not an avatar issue, this will happen with all avatars blocked excluding my own, and my own avatar being an armature with no mesh for optimization.)",
